039","text":"宣王喜文學游説之士，自如騶衍、淳于髡、田駢、接子、愼到、環淵之徒七十六人，皆賜列第，爲上大夫，不治而議論。是以齊稷下學士復盛，且數百千人。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m039-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"宣王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002768","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m039-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"騶衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002794","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m039-0015","start":15,"end":18,"surface":"淳于髡","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002766","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m039-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"田駢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002795","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m039-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"接子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002796","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m039-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"愼到","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002797","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m039-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"環淵","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p002798","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m039-0032","start":32,"end":36,"surface":"七十六人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、稱謂或索隱述贊短稱待核，不補姓名及成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-046-tian:m039-0056","start":56,"end":60,"surface":"稷下學士","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"群體、對話、稱謂或索隱述贊短稱待核，不補姓名及成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-046-tian","book_id":"b-shiji-046","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-046-tian"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:p004","text":"其次騶衍，後孟子。騶衍睹有國者益淫侈，不能尚德，若大雅整之於身，施及黎庶矣。乃深觀陰陽消息而作怪迂之變，終始、大聖之篇十餘萬言。其語閎大不經，必先驗小物，推而大之，至於無垠。先序今以上至黃帝，學者所共術，大并世盛衰，因載其禨祥度制，推而遠之，至天地未生，窈冥不可考而原也。先列中國名山大川，通谷禽獸，水土所殖，物類所珍，因而推之，及海外人之所不能睹。稱引天地剖判以來，五德轉移，治各有宜，而符應若茲。以為儒者所謂中國者，於天下乃八十一分居其一分耳。中國名曰赤縣神州。赤縣神州內自有九州，禹之序九州是也，不得為州數。中國外如赤縣神州者九，乃所謂九州也。於是有裨海環之，人民禽獸莫能相通者，如一區中者，乃為一州。如此者九，乃有大瀛海環其外，天地之際焉。其術皆此類也。然要其歸，必止乎仁義節儉，君臣上下六親之施，始也濫耳。王公大人初見其術，懼然顧化，其後不能行之。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m004-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"騶衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004291","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m004-0006","start":6,"end":8,"surface":"孟子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004280","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m004-0009","start":9,"end":11,"surface":"騶衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004291","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m004-0093","start":93,"end":95,"surface":"黃帝","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004292","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m004-0166","start":166,"end":169,"surface":"海外人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、時代合稱或匿名說話者，不補成員與姓名；子思之門人不當子思本人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m004-0243","start":243,"end":244,"surface":"禹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004293","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m004-0358","start":358,"end":362,"surface":"王公大人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、時代合稱或匿名說話者，不補成員與姓名；子思之門人不當子思本人。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun","book_id":"b-shiji-074","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-074-mengxun"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:p005","text":"是以騶子重於齊。適梁，惠王郊迎，執賓主之禮。適趙，平原君側行撇席。如燕，昭王擁彗先驅，請列弟子之座而受業，筑碣石宮，身親往師之。作主運。其游諸侯見尊禮如此，豈與仲尼菜色陳蔡，孟軻困於齊梁同乎哉！故武王以仁義伐紂而王，伯夷餓不食周粟；衛靈公問陳，而孔子不答；梁惠王謀欲攻趙，孟軻稱大王去邠。此豈有意阿世俗茍合而已哉！持方枘欲內圜鑿，其能入乎？或曰，伊尹負鼎而勉湯以王，百里奚飯牛車下而繆公用霸，作先合，然後引之大道。騶衍其言雖不軌，儻亦有牛鼎之意乎？","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0002","start":2,"end":4,"surface":"騶子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004291","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0011","start":11,"end":13,"surface":"惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004278","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0025","start":25,"end":28,"surface":"平原君","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004294","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0036","start":36,"end":38,"surface":"昭王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004295","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"仲尼","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004289","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0087","start":87,"end":89,"surface":"孟軻","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004280","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0098","start":98,"end":100,"surface":"武王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004296","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0104","start":104,"end":105,"surface":"紂","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004297","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0108","start":108,"end":110,"surface":"伯夷","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004298","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0116","start":116,"end":119,"surface":"衛靈公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004299","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0123","start":123,"end":125,"surface":"孔子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004300","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0128","start":128,"end":131,"surface":"梁惠王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004278","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0136","start":136,"end":138,"surface":"孟軻","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004280","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0139","start":139,"end":141,"surface":"大王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004301","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0170","start":170,"end":172,"surface":"或曰","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、時代合稱或匿名說話者，不補成員與姓名；子思之門人不當子思本人。"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0173","start":173,"end":175,"surface":"伊尹","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004302","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0179","start":179,"end":180,"surface":"湯","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004303","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0183","start":183,"end":186,"surface":"百里奚","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004304","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0191","start":191,"end":193,"surface":"繆公","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004305","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m005-0207","start":207,"end":209,"surface":"騶衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004291","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun","book_id":"b-shiji-074","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-074-mengxun"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:p006","text":"自騶衍與齊之稷下先生，如淳于髡、慎到、環淵、接子、田駢、騶奭之徒，各著書言治亂之事，以干世主，豈可勝道哉！","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m006-0001","start":1,"end":3,"surface":"騶衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004291","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m006-0008","start":8,"end":10,"surface":"先生","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"稷下先生為群稱，不專指隨後列舉的淳于髡。原錨點ID與字位保留。"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m006-0012","start":12,"end":15,"surface":"淳于髡","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004306","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m006-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"慎到","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004307","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m006-0019","start":19,"end":21,"surface":"環淵","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004308","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m006-0022","start":22,"end":24,"surface":"接子","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004309","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m006-0025","start":25,"end":27,"surface":"田駢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004310","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m006-0028","start":28,"end":30,"surface":"騶奭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004311","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m006-0030","start":30,"end":32,"surface":"之徒","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、族屬、學說合稱或匿名說話者保持未定；不將黃老儒墨自動拆為人名，也不補群體成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m006-0044","start":44,"end":46,"surface":"世主","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、族屬、學說合稱或匿名說話者保持未定；不將黃老儒墨自動拆為人名，也不補群體成員。"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun","book_id":"b-shiji-074","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-074-mengxun"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:p009","text":"騶奭者，齊諸騶子，亦頗采騶衍之術以紀文。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m009-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"騶奭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004311","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m009-0004","start":4,"end":8,"surface":"齊諸騶子","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、族屬、學說合稱或匿名說話者保持未定；不將黃老儒墨自動拆為人名，也不補群體成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m009-0012","start":12,"end":14,"surface":"騶衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004291","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun","book_id":"b-shiji-074","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-074-mengxun"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:p011","text":"荀卿，趙人。年五十始來游學於齊。騶衍之術迂大而閎辯；奭也文具難施；淳于髡久與處，時有得善言。故齊人頌曰：「談天衍，雕龍奭，炙轂過髡。」田駢之屬皆已死齊襄王時，而荀卿最為老師。齊尚修列大夫之缺，而荀卿三為祭酒焉。齊人或讒荀卿，荀卿乃適楚，而春申君以為蘭陵令。春申君死而荀卿廢，因家蘭陵。李斯嘗為弟子，已而相秦。荀卿嫉濁世之政，亡國亂君相屬，不遂大道而營於巫祝，信禨祥，鄙儒小拘，如莊周等又猾稽亂俗，於是推儒、墨、道德之行事興壞，序列著數萬言而卒。因葬蘭陵。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"荀卿","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004318","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0016","start":16,"end":18,"surface":"騶衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004291","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0026","start":26,"end":27,"surface":"奭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004311","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0033","start":33,"end":36,"surface":"淳于髡","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004306","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0055","start":55,"end":56,"surface":"衍","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004291","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0059","start":59,"end":60,"surface":"奭","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004311","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0064","start":64,"end":65,"surface":"髡","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004306","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0067","start":67,"end":69,"surface":"田駢","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004310","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0069","start":69,"end":71,"surface":"之屬","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、族屬、學說合稱或匿名說話者保持未定；不將黃老儒墨自動拆為人名，也不補群體成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0074","start":74,"end":77,"surface":"齊襄王","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004319","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0080","start":80,"end":82,"surface":"荀卿","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004318","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0097","start":97,"end":99,"surface":"荀卿","kind":"person","person_id":"cbr-p004318","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0105","start":105,"end":108,"surface":"齊人或","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名群體、族屬、學說合稱或匿名說話者保持未定；不將黃老儒墨自動拆為人名，也不補群體成員。"},{"id":"c-shiji-074-mengxun:m011-0109","sta